 visualizes “Intent Bubbles”—zones of the motor cortex lighting up before a physical action is taken.","position":{"start":{"line":52,"column":1},"end":{"line":52,"column":1}},"key":"a6Kj2ifLcS"}],"key":"JO8rFHVKK3"}],"key":"jvKqUmKyEK"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":1},"end":{"line":54,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Synergy: If SciStream detects a lag in the neural-to-digital link, syGlass can highlight the “bottleneck” area in red within the Commander’s field of view, allowing for an immediate tactical swap or mission abort.","position":{"start":{"line":53,"column":1},"end":{"line":53,"column":1}},"key":"EzWGIuZLhL"}],"key":"fa9ZckUEFc"}],"key":"OJ3l4aXG0m"}],"key":"rCW59pS272"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1},"end":{"line":55,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"“Augmented Intent”","position":{"start":{"line":55,"column":1},"end":{"line":55,"column":1}},"key":"pwaN0FHFjV"}],"identifier":"augmented-intent","label":"“Augmented Intent”","html_id":"augmented-intent","implicit":true,"key":"SN8ziJyE8f"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"spread":false,"position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":1},"end":{"line":58,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":1},"end":{"line":56,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Sensory Injection: The Commander can “push” tactical data directly into the user’s sensory perception. For example, injecting a “thermal sense” or “spatial ping” into the user’s parietal lobe, allowing them to “feel” an enemy’s location without looking at a screen.","position":{"start":{"line":56,"column":1},"end":{"line":56,"column":1}},"key":"faIX6gRjUM"}],"key":"s0M5wTvFNe"}],"key":"alRRbHzxtW"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":57,"column":1},"end":{"line":58,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Focus Steering: By manipulating the XR dashboard, the Commander can boost the user’s visual processing or auditory gain during high-stress moments, effectively “tuning” the user’s brain for the mission.","position":{"start":{"line":57,"column":1},"end":{"line":57,"column":1}},"key":"OuzegJDLCA"}],"key":"ZKFSNgXwNZ"}],"key":"vvdEzin8HJ"}],"key":"eRddBiSXNp"},{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":59,"column":1},"end":{"line":59,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"For the Physician:","position":{"start":{"line":59,"column":1},"end":{"line":59,"column":1}},"key":"FPI4mLuqJq"}],"identifier":"for-the-physician","label":"For the Physician:","html_id":"for-the-physician","implicit":true,"key":"p5DzweDW8Y"},{"type":"heading","depth":4,"position":{"start":{"line":60,"column":1},"end":{"line":60,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"“Precision Diagnostic Suite”","position":{"start":{"line":60,"column":1},"end":{"line":60,"column":1}},"key":"d65FsrvnvX"}],"identifier":"precision-diagnostic-suite","label":"“Precision Diagnostic Suite”","html_id":"precision-diagnostic-suite","implicit":true,"key":"Wp61srtNun"},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"spread":false,"position":{"start":{"line":61,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":61,"column":1},"end":{"line":61,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"syGlass Implementation: Enables “Virtual Micro-Slicing.” The Physician can freeze a SciStream live-feed and use syGlass tools to measure the density of neural firing or track electrode degradation in 1:1 scale.","position":{"start":{"line":61,"column":1},"end":{"line":61,"column":1}},"key":"wYwr2DDVku"}],"key":"XW9VR7DZPd"}],"key":"NMUu85dEa4"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":62,"column":1},"end":{"line":63,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{